---
title: 'Line Series Test'
---

## Continuous Data Animation

What to test:

- Trigger each data-mutation action and confirm lines, markers and labels animate without snapping.
- Toggle series visibility mid-animation and check stacked totals re-flow correctly.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Continuous-Data Animation Test Cases" name="continuous-animation" type="generated" /%}

## Category Data Animation

What to test:

- Add and remove categories at the start and end and confirm the line slides rather than redraws.
- Reset the data and confirm the chart returns to its initial state.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Category-Data Animation Test Cases" name="category-animation" type="generated" /%}

## Integrated Charts Category Data Animation

What to test:

- Insert and remove categories in the middle of the series and confirm both lines animate in lock-step.
- Confirm axis labels track category insertions without jitter.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Integrated Category-Data Animation Test Cases" name="integrated-category-animation" type="generated" /%}

## Marker vs. Path Animation

What to test:

- Watch the 60-second ease-out animation and confirm the path and markers stay in sync throughout.
- Reset mid-animation and confirm the chart restarts cleanly.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Very Slow Ease Out Animation Test" name="easeOut-very-slow" type="generated" /%}
